{"id":"0e25902f9c93ca41","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-hif-kurtz-weak2.md","title":"超免疫自由点上Kurtz与弱2随机等价","display":"thm-hif-kurtz-weak2 — 超免疫自由点上Kurtz与弱2随机等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-hif-kurtz-weak2","aliases":["43-thm-hif-kurtz-weak2"],"display":"thm-hif-kurtz-weak2 — 超免疫自由点上Kurtz与弱2随机等价","depends_on":["[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]","[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]","[[43-df-weak2random]]","[[43-df-effective-open]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Theorem 11.16.14; Proposition 11.16.15 (Yu Liang)","source_printed_pages":"296","source_pdf_pages":"316","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-15-round2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-hif-kurtz-weak2"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-hif-kurtz-weak2</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hif-kurtz-weak2 — 超免疫自由点上Kurtz与弱2随机等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"df08310d02ee0072\" href=\"?note=df08310d02ee0072\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-free\">43-df-hyperimmune-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1a145b88092ce22e\" href=\"?note=1a145b88092ce22e\" title=\"43-df-weak2random\">43-df-weak2random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 11.16.14; Proposition 11.16.15 (Yu Liang)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"296"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"316"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}(X)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"df08310d02ee0072\" href=\"?note=df08310d02ee0072\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-free\">43-df-hyperimmune-free</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Weak2Random}\">\\(\\mathrm{Weak2Random}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1a145b88092ce22e\" href=\"?note=1a145b88092ce22e\" title=\"43-df-weak2random\">43-df-weak2random</a>；有效开集与测度见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\iff\\mathrm{Weak2Random}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\iff\\mathrm{Weak2Random}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>弱2随机必避开有效闭零类。反向若X处于某个有效Π₂零类⋂_nU_n，则用X计算每个U_n枚举到包含X的阶段h(n)。超免疫自由性给出可计算逐点上界g。令C_n为第g(n)阶段得到的有限柱集并，则X∈⋂_nC_n⊆⋂_nU_n；前者是有效闭零类，与Kurtz随机矛盾。最终支配通过调整有限初段可改成逐点上界，未要求从h编号一致求g。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 11.16.14; Proposition 11.16.15 (Yu Liang)，印刷页296，PDF页316。核对了来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"df08310d02ee0072","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-weak2random","status":"resolved","id":"1a145b88092ce22e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-weak2random]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-open","status":"resolved","id":"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-open]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"df08310d02ee0072","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$ 且 $\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}(X)$，